  Slug: even-tempered-tanuki
  DisplayName: Even-Tempered Tanuki
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: You're possessed of a serenity uncommon to other tanuki, who always
    seem to be flying off the handle. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving
    throws against emotion effects. If you roll a success at a saving throw against
    an emotion effect, you get a critical success instead, but when you roll a failure
    at a saving throw against an emotion effect, you get a critical failure instead.
